                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg1573">p. 1573</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d975-f4" n="4" xml:id="d975-f4-content">
                <p>Department instruction CA–3475 to the Embassy in New Delhi, Jan. 5, 1954,
                    requested an estimate of India’s anticipated reaction to the establishment of a
                    U.S. base in Ceylon (711.56346E/1–554).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
